<div
   class="nist-block"
>
  
    
        <h1 class="nist-page__title">Meet the Constants</h1>

        
  </div>

<div
   class="nist-block"
>
  
    
      <div class="text-with-summary">
  
  
  
      <p>The revised SI rests on a foundation of seven values, known as the constants. (SI is the acronym for the International System of Units, which is informally known as the metric system.) The values of the constants are the same everywhere in the universe. In the revised SI, these constants completely define the seven base SI units, from the second to the candela.</p><p>The below graphic shows the seven base SI units and the constants used to define them. <strong>Click on each of the SI units (outer boxes) to see which constants (inner boxes) define them.</strong></p><div data-entity-type="block_content" data-entity-uuid="4b95c49b-c4d6-4b6a-88da-a2da25b259a5" data-embed-button="block" data-entity-embed-display="view_mode:block_content.full" data-langcode="en" data-entity-embed-display-settings="[]" class="embedded-entity">  <div style="max-width: 450px; margin-left: auto ; margin-right: auto ;"><svg class="nist-svg--scalable" viewBox="0 0 443.33 443.33"> <defs>
	<style type="text/css">.cls-1 {
        fill: #ffd28b;
      }

      .cls-2, .cls-3 {
        fill: #3c3c3b;
      }

      .cls-3 {
        stroke: #3c3c3b;
        stroke-miterlimit: 10;
        stroke-width: 0.5px;
      }

      .cls-4 {
        fill: #f5a800;
      }

      .cls-5 {
        fill: #fff;
      }

      .cls-6 {
        fill: #ffb68d;
      }

      .cls-7 {
        fill: #ff671d;
      }

      .cls-8 {
        fill: #f2978e;
      }

      .cls-9 {
        fill: #ce0e2d;
      }

      .cls-10 {
        fill: #a67ecc;
      }

      .cls-11 {
        fill: #410099;
      }

      .cls-12 {
        fill: #e499cf;
      }

      .cls-13 {
        fill: #c017a2;
      }

      .cls-14 {
        fill: #7da9dc;
      }

      .cls-15 {
        fill: #005cb9;
      }

      .cls-16 {
        fill: #b2d28e;
      }

      .cls-17 {
        fill: #61a60e;
      }

      .cls-18 {
        fill: #1d1d1b;
        opacity: 0.93;
      }
	</style>
	</defs>
